  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preparatory activities to support progressive involvement of Georgia, the Republic of Moldova and Ukraine in the activities of Transport Community</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The project will support the implementation of preparatory activities within the initial stage of involvement of Georgia, Republic of Moldova and Ukraine in the Transport Community as permanent observers. These activities will facilitate the preparation of a follow-up fully-fledged programme to allow for closer approximation of Georgia, Moldova and Ukraine with the Transport Community and their participation in the extended number of activities.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
